cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "BEAST: Bayesian Exascale Atmospheric Swin Transformer"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/RAI-SCC/beast"
abstract: >-
  BEAST is a distributed, probabilistic weather-prediction model built on
  PyTorch. It predicts future atmospheric states from ERA5 reanalysis data
  using a Bayesian Swin-style transformer sharded across a four-dimensional
  process mesh, enabling training at exascale.
keywords:
  - weather prediction
  - machine learning
  - Bayesian deep learning
  - transformer
  - distributed training
  - exascale
  - ERA5
version: 0.0.1
